{"seq":3,"slug":"campaign-roi-creator-ltv","title":"达人营销 ROI 与长期合作分级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-influencer-kol-marketing-platform/campaign-performance-settle/campaign-roi-creator-ltv","wordCount":2925,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"达人营销-roi-与长期合作分级\">达人营销 ROI 与长期合作分级</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结算单付出去之后，还有一个更重要的问题：这笔钱花得值不值，下一轮该给谁更多。这一篇是整个 hub 的收口——它把前三章的所有数据（达人的规模与风险、合作的交付质量、内容的授权复用、效果与成本）合成一个可执行的决策：谁升级、谁保持、谁降级、谁剔除。</p>\n<p>核心概念有两个。<strong>ROI</strong> 回答「这一笔合作赚不赚」，是单次合作的评估。<strong>达人 LTV</strong> 回答「这个达人长期值多少」，是把达人当作可复购的供给方来经营的视角。两者的区别很关键：一个 ROI 为负的单次合作可能仍然是值得的——如果它带来了宝贵的受众数据、一条高价值的可复用素材、或者验证了一个新市场的可行性。把 ROI 当作唯一判据会系统性地放弃长期价值。</p>\n<p>第三个概念是<strong>分级（tiering of relationship）</strong>。这里的分级与第 1 章的「规模分层」不同：那个是按粉丝量分档，这个是按<strong>合作价值</strong>分档，决定的是资源投入方式（是否给年框、是否优先响应、是否给独家）。</p>\n<p>本流程的输入是三处：效果数据（<a href=\"influencer-attribution-track\">达人内容效果追踪归因</a>）、成本数据（<a href=\"creator-fee-commission-settle\">坑位费/佣金结算</a>）、质量与风险数据（<a href=\"../content-review-rights/creator-content-review\">达人内容审核与合规</a> 与 <a href=\"../creator-discovery-profile/creator-tier-fraud-signal\">达人分层与水军/刷量信号</a>）。输出是一份分级名单，回流到 <a href=\"../creator-discovery-profile/creator-discovery-multiplatform\">多平台达人发现与数据接入</a> 的达人主数据与下一轮的候选池。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[归因效果数据] --&gt; D[单次合作 ROI]&#10;  B[结算成本数据] --&gt; D&#10;  C[交付质量/审核返工率] --&gt; E[资产价值]&#10;  F[风险历史] --&gt; G[合作风险]&#10;  D --&gt; H[达人价值评分]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{分级判定}&#10;  I --&gt;|高价值低风险| J[长期年框 升级]&#10;  I --&gt;|中等| K[保持 常规合作]&#10;  I --&gt;|低价值| L[降级 观察]&#10;  I --&gt;|高风险或负价值| M[剔除 黑名单]&#10;  J --&gt; N[回流候选池与主数据]&#10;  K --&gt; N&#10;  L --&gt; N&#10;  M --&gt; N\">graph TD\n  A[归因效果数据] --&gt; D[单次合作 ROI]\n  B[结算成本数据] --&gt; D\n  C[交付质量/审核返工率] --&gt; E[资产价值]\n  F[风险历史] --&gt; G[合作风险]\n  D --&gt; H[达人价值评分]\n  E --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{分级判定}\n  I --&gt;|高价值低风险| J[长期年框 升级]\n  I --&gt;|中等| K[保持 常规合作]\n  I --&gt;|低价值| L[降级 观察]\n  I --&gt;|高风险或负价值| M[剔除 黑名单]\n  J --&gt; N[回流候选池与主数据]\n  K --&gt; N\n  L --&gt; N\n  M --&gt; N</pre><h2 id=\"单次合作-roi-的计算口径\">单次合作 ROI 的计算口径</h2><h3 id=\"分子该放什么\">分子该放什么</h3><p>ROI 的分子是「合作带来的收益」，但「收益」的定义直接决定结论。三种口径由严到宽。</p>\n<p><strong>直接成交毛利</strong>：只算归因到该达人的成交，乘以毛利率。最保守、最可验证，但会严重低估种草型达人。</p>\n<p><strong>含复用产出的收益</strong>：加上该达人的内容被品牌二次投放（付费广告、官方账号）产生的收益。这是达人营销相对其他渠道的独特价值——素材可以复用。计算上需要把 <a href=\"../content-review-rights/content-rights-reuse-distribute\">内容授权与多渠道复用分发</a> 的 <code>usage_grant</code> 记录与广告平台的效果数据关联。</p>\n<p><strong>含品牌资产增值</strong>：再加上品牌搜索量、官方账号涨粉、内容素材库的长期价值。这部分难以货币化，实务上不做精确计算，只作为定性加分项。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI_{direct} = \\frac{GrossProfit_{attributed} - Cost_{total}}{Cost_{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">oss</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Cost_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">os</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是坑位费加佣金（不含预扣税，见 <a href=\"creator-fee-commission-settle\">坑位费/佣金结算</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分母的完整性\">分母的完整性</h3><p>分母最容易算错的地方是<strong>漏算成本项</strong>。除了坑位费与佣金，还有：样品成本与物流关税、内容二次投放的媒体费用、平台服务费、内部人力分摊。漏算样品与关税在跨境场景下尤其容易造成 ROI 虚高——一件高价值样品的成本加上跨境关税可能接近微型达人的坑位费。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>常见遗漏</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>坑位费</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>佣金</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>与归因口径绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样品 + 物流 + 关税</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨境场景下显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次投放媒体费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>复用收益必须配复用成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台/通道服务费</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>跨境付款的通道费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部人力</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>通常按比例分摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>原则是：<strong>收益与成本必须匹配同一口径</strong>。计算「含复用产出的收益」时就必须计入复用成本；只算直接成交毛利时才能只算坑位费与佣金。</p>\n<h2 id=\"达人-ltv-的建模\">达人 LTV 的建模</h2><h3 id=\"为什么单次-roi-不够\">为什么单次 ROI 不够</h3><p>一个达人第一次合作的 ROI 是 −20%，但他带来了一条被复用半年、持续产生转化的素材，并且验证了该达人在西语市场的影响力。第三次合作时，双方已磨合完毕，brief 沟通成本降低、返工率下降、内容原生度提高，ROI 转正。只看第一次的结果就会错误地放弃他。</p>\n<p>达人 LTV 要捕捉的正是这种<strong>边际改善</strong>。它有三条与单次 ROI 不同的假设。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单次 ROI</th>\n<th>达人 LTV</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间跨度</td>\n<td>单次合作周期</td>\n<td>预期合作次数 × 单次周期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通成本</td>\n<td>全额计入</td>\n<td>随合作次数递减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>素材复用</td>\n<td>只算当期</td>\n<td>计入长期复用产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容质量</td>\n<td>当期返工率</td>\n<td>质量随磨合提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>当期风险分</td>\n<td>风险随样本增加而更可信</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用留存视角建模\">用留存视角建模</h3><p>一种可操作的做法是把达人 LTV 写成「预期合作次数 × 单次净贡献」的形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>K</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LTV = \\sum_{k=1}^{K} p_k \\cdot \\frac{Contribution_k}{(1 + r)^{t_k}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1304em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7196em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「进行到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次合作」的概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Contribution_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ib</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次合作的净贡献，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是折现率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次合作的时间。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需要用历史数据估计——也就是<strong>达人的合作留存曲线</strong>：合作过一次的达人，有多大比例会合作第二次、第三次。</p>\n<p>这个模型的价值在于它把「要不要继续合作」转化为一个可以用数据回答的问题。而估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 需要平台已积累足够的合作历史，因此新平台上只能先用简单启发式（如用最近 90 天的复购率）代理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合作频次与内容疲劳\">合作频次与内容疲劳</h3><p>LTV 不能简单假设「合作次数越多越好」。同一个达人对同一受众反复推广同一品牌会产生<strong>内容疲劳</strong>：粉丝识别出这是重复广告，互动率下降，甚至产生反感。因此存在一个最优合作频次区间，超过它边际收益转负。</p>\n<p>工程上需要监控的最小指标是：同一达人连续推广同一品牌时，每次内容的互动率变化趋势。若呈持续下降，说明接近疲劳点，应当在下次合作前拉长间隔或更换内容角度。这也解释了为什么「独家期」是对双方都有意义的条款（见 <a href=\"../outreach-brief-contract/sample-seeding-contract\">寄样与合同/合规条款</a>）——它限制品牌过度使用同一个达人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级维度与判定规则\">分级维度与判定规则</h2><h3 id=\"四个评分维度\">四个评分维度</h3><p>分级由四个维度合成，每个维度都有明确的数据来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>权重倾向</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>效果</td>\n<td>归因结果</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>单位成本产出，非绝对产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>审核返工率、按时交付率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>协作成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资产</td>\n<td>复用产出、素材数量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>独特价值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>风险分、历史异常</td>\n<td>一票否决</td>\n<td>高风险直接降级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>效果维度必须用单位成本产出而非绝对产出</strong>。绝对产出会系统性偏向头部达人（粉丝多自然产出多），掩盖了微型达人的高性价比。这与第 1 章 <a href=\"../creator-discovery-profile/audience-creator-fit\">受众画像与品牌契合度</a> 中「按单位成本契合度排序」的原则一致——贯穿整个 hub 的评估视角都是<strong>单位成本</strong>而非绝对规模。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分级规则与处置\">分级规则与处置</h3><p>四条分级规则，判定顺序是自顶向下的短路判断。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;grading_policy&quot;: &quot;creator-grading-v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evaluated_for&quot;: { &quot;campaign_id&quot;: &quot;C-2026-0912&quot;, &quot;window_days&quot;: 180 },&#10;  &quot;rules&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;blacklist&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;risk_score_max&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 70 }, &quot;or&quot;: { &quot;roi_direct&quot;: { &quot;lt&quot;: -0.5 } } },&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;remove_from_candidate_pool&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;高风险或严重负价值，需双人确认后解除&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;strategic&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;risk_score_max&quot;: { &quot;lt&quot;: 40 },&#10;        &quot;collabs_completed&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 3 },&#10;        &quot;unit_cost_roi&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 0.5 },&#10;        &quot;on_time_rate&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 0.9 }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;offer_annual_frame&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;优先响应、可谈判独家、预留预算&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;growth&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: { &quot;risk_score_max&quot;: { &quot;lt&quot;: 60 }, &quot;collabs_completed&quot;: { &quot;gte&quot;: 1 } },&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;keep_regular&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;常规合作，观察下一轮表现&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;tier&quot;: &quot;observe&quot;,&#10;      &quot;when&quot;: {},&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;reduce_frequency&quot;,&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;默认档；连续两轮停留此档则移出候选池&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"grading_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"creator-grading-v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evaluated_for\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"campaign_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"C-2026-0912\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">180</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blacklist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-